<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Saaŋ koc kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Saaŋ koc kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Saaŋ na Saak na Piyeer ɓeɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaahay ci tiik ciŋ ɓa uup woyu ŋ teereeci nikiis ci na naandsuke kipes kiŋ Yeesu. Marka Saaŋ ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ finho kakaan ki na hulti na rapɗuukiŋ Yeesu, a taambkohiɗ Maryaama, yaayiŋ Yeesu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:25-27">Saaŋ 19:25-27</ref></char></note> Ŋ mirndaani a yi adgohee ɓi Jangu, ŋ ɗiska woysee Asi ŋ jamanoonaam (ɓak ngaŋ ɗiski Turki nik woti-woti). Ŋ jamanoonaam, weɗ a fiisoh "Yegɗohiŋ Muci Saaŋ fiis", na "Fiisi Saaŋ koc kaɓɗoh" wii, na fiis kanak wiiriis ci a kaɓɗoh, na teerndiŋ "Teeɓ ki", wi na woye ŋ in ci na haye ŋ fikiiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:1">Teeɓ ki 1:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ kaɓɗohɗi fiisii wuu ɓo' yino wala wuu Jangu sangam, wa mand haa a fiisa ne ɓi jangu laayiɗ mina njirñiɗkoh. Wa miniɗ nik ne a koca kaɓɗoh ŋ Janguuci a adgohee, laam a inheen nikohaaɗiŋ ɓa te a ɓaahndoheen haf ce nga.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18-21">1 Saaŋ 2:18-21</ref></char></note> Janguuceem sah, ceɗ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> fiis kaɓɗoh ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2-3">Teeɓ ki 2–3</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɓi ɓo' faɗeen Janguuci, laam ɓa koseeɗi yegɗoh ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18-19">1 Saaŋ 2:18-19</ref></char></note> Saaŋ fiis wuu ɓi risee nga ne a ñaah ɓa te a ñiinɗiɗ ɓa kiyooh ci etohu keeh-keeh ŋ kos.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Saaŋ koc kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Rangsohaani : Woo ki na onohe kipes ki <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pes ŋ siñaar na waaɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:5-2:17">1:5–2:17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 2:18-27">2:18-27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nik kuɓuuciŋ Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 2:28-3:24">2:28–3:24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Inhisoh <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> na liiɓiŋ sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 4:1-6">4:1-6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Waaɗohiŋ Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 4:7-21">4:7-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kos seedeeni Kooh seede Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 5:1-15">5:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Reehɗohaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 5:16-21">5:16-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Woo ki na onohe kipes ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Ini raakee, kooɗoh ŋ camba poyi, ɓoo kerahhaa, hotoottaa na has ciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo marakkaa baahiɗ te ɓoo laallaa na yaah ciŋ ɓoo, weɗ Woo ki na onohe kipes ki. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Kipes keem teeɓohkiɗ te ɓoo hotiɗa. Ɓoo na seede'ee wa te ɓoo yegɗee ɗu wa, weɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe, wi nikee na Baabi te wa teeɓukka ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Mbaa ini ɓoo hot, ɓoo kerahhaa, ɓoo ɓii nam ɗu wa yegiɗ, ne ɗu nik yino na ɓoo, ɓoo hun nik yino na Baabi na <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Te ɓoo ɓii fiis ɗu in cii ne sumiŋ ɓoo mit.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pes ŋ ɗooƴ siñaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Yegɗohi ɓoo kerah ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa te ɓoo yegɗee ɗu wa weɗ ne Kooh a siñaar te ali ñuus nikɗi nga ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Ɓoo woo ne ɓoo yino na Kooh, te ɓoo tiindee ŋ ñuus ɗah, ɓoo na leye te ɓoo pesɗi ŋ keeh. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Waaye ɓoo nik ŋ siñaar findi Kooh nikoh ŋ siñaar ɗah, ndeem, ɓoo yino ŋ harmban ɓoo te ñif miŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yeesu wa ɗii hooliɗ ɓoo ŋ bakaaɗ ci jen.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Ɓoo woo ne ɓoo raakɗi bakaaɗ ɗah, ɓoo na ñaañohe haf ɓoo, te keeh ki nikɗi nga ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Ɓoo teyɗuk bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo ŋ fiki Kooh ɗah, Kooh cariɗ oolku te a yurhiɗ. A hey ɓoo ɗaase, a hooliɗ ɓoo ŋ yurhaaɗi nu nik. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Ɓoo woo ne ɓoo bakaaɗɗi ɗah, ɓoo na woye ne Kooh leyoh, te woo kiŋ ɗe nikɗi nga ɓoo.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Komaakciŋ ngo, mi yii fiis ɗu in ceem ne ɗu bakaaɗuu. Waaye yino nga ɓoo bakaaɗ ɗah, ɓoo raakiɗ Yi ngelɗan ɓoo ŋ fiki Baabi, a Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, Yurhiɗi. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Laam, a yi eɗoh haf ce ne a seeƴkohu wuu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo, te wa wuu ɓoo dong haa waaye wuu ɓi Adina jen.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakohi asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Ini na teeɓe ɓoo ne ɓoo inhiɗ Heɗi, weɗ ne ɓoo taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Yi na woye ne a inhiɗ Kooh, te a taambiɗɗi nakoh ciŋ ɗe, yeem leyoh te keeh ki nikɗi nga ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Waaye ɓoyi na taambɗe woo kiŋ ɗe, waaɗi a waaɗ Kooh na nike mitiɗ sik te wa nik keeh nga ɗe - ŋ ineem ɓoo inah ne ɓoo ɓii ŋ Kooh. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Yaa nu woo ne a yii ŋ Kooh ɗah, a joy pesoh findi Yeesu pesohe.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, wa nakoh as weɗ maa fiisee ɗu haa, wa nakoh maañiɗ te ɗu rahasa wa wa camb, te nakoheem, e woo ki ɗu kerah. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Moona ini maa fiisee ɗu, wa nakoh as keeh-keeh ŋ kipes kiŋ Kiristaani, findi wa nam nikoh as keeh-keeh ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗu, ñuusi wa ɗii coot te siñaari siñaarɗiɗ po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Yi na woye ne a yii ŋ siñaari te a waaɗɗi yi a ɓaah na ɗe kos, a ris ŋ ñuusi poyi. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Ɓi waaɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɓa kosiɗ ci, ɓa gen ŋ siñaari te ali in kafndanɗi ɓa. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Waaye ɓi waaɗɗi ɓaah ciŋ ɓa, ɓa ɗi ŋ ñuusi ; ɓa na tiinde ŋ ɗooƴ ñuusi te ɓa inahɗi ɗiski ɓa na kaɗe, ñuusi fuulɗiɗ has ciŋ ɓa.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓo' nu waaɗ Adina ɗah, waaɗɗi Baabi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Mi yii fiis ɗu, komaakci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:12">Ɗu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:12">sagu Yeesu Kiristaa.<verse eid="1JN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Mi yii fiis ɗu, baab ci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:13">Ɗu inhiɗ Yi nik ŋ camba poyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:13">Mi yii fiis ɗu, komaakci fiir ci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:13">Ɗu saahiɗ Seytaani.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Mi yii fiis ɗu, komaakci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">Ɗu inhiɗ Baabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">Mi yii fiis ɗu, baab ci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">Ɗu inhiɗ Yi nik ŋ camba poyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">Mi yii fiis ɗu, komaakci fiir ci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">Ɗu raakiɗ hatil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">woo kiŋ Kooh gen nga ɗu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 2:14">te ɗu saahiɗ Seytaani.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Kinaat waaɗ Adina na in ci nik ŋ ɗooƴ Adina. Ɓo' waaɗ Adina ɗah, waaɗ Baabi nikɗi nga ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />In ci nik ŋ Adina jen, findi taambiɗ kiñin, maɗ in ci has na hote, na yaksiɗuk ŋ raak-raak, ceem jen ca ina Baabi haa, ca ina Adina. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Te kat, Adina na reehe reeh na in ci na maɗse nga, waaye yi na tume ini Kooh waaɗ genan gen po faw.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sangiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Kuɓuuciŋ ngo, ɓoo ɓii ŋ jamanooci mirndoh. Ɗu kerhiɗ ne sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani yii hay, te woti-woti, sangiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani laayiɗ, tahha po ɓoo inhiɗ ne ɓoo ɓii ŋ jamanooci mirndoh. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Ɓa puliɗ nga ɓoo waaye ɓa ɓaaheeɗi nga ɓoo ; laam ɓa ɓaaheen nga ɓoo ɗah, ɓa heen rise na ɓoo. Waaye ineem teeɓohiɗ ne ali yino nga ɓa ɓaahɗi nga ɓoo.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Ɗu nak, ɗu rahsiɗ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, tahha po ɗu jen ɗu inhiɗ keeh ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Mi yii fiis ɗu, wa nikɗi haa ne ɗu inahɗi keeh ki, waaye ɗu inhiɗa te ɗu inhiɗ ne ali lee na puloheeɗi ŋ keeh. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Ya ɓa leyohi ? E yi taas ne Yeesu a yi Kiristaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ jamanoonaam, raakiɗ ɓi teyɗukee ne Kiristaani nikee <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, a hay hay ŋ Adina, waaye a nikeeɗi ɓo' njaay findi ɓoo, a nikee puuɗis, a aassa ɓo' njaay teeku Yeesu. Kon nga ɓa Yeesu pulohɗi Eel ci, a hayɗi Adina, te a nikeeɗi Kiristaani, a nikeeɗi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. Saaŋ woo ndii ne ɓo' nu woo ineem ɗah, a leyoh, te ngaŋ saar 4, aaya 3, a woo ne ɓoyeem, liiɓ ciŋ ɗe, ca liiɓ ciŋ sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani. Nama marak saar 4, aaya 15 na saar 5, aaya 1.</char></note>. Yeem, a yi sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani, yi taas Baabi na Kuɓki. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Yaa nu taasuk Kuɓki ɗah, a namɗi raak Baabi. Yaa nu teyɗuk Kuɓki ɗah, a namiɗ raak Baabi.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Ini ɗu kerah ŋ camba poyi, risaat nga ɗu. Ini ɗu kerah ŋ camba poyi ris nga ɗu ɗah, ɗu naman ris ŋ Kuɓki na Baabi. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Te ini a gap ɓoo, weɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="1JN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Ineem weɗ ŋ waaɗee ɗu fiis ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi na muuƴɗee ɗu.<verse eid="1JN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Ini kaɗ nga ɗu, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ɗu rahsoh nga ɗe hey gene nga ɗu, te ɗu etohɗi ɓo' wiiriis jangɗee ɗu ; Fuuɗsi yii jangiɗ ɗu in ci jen, te ini a na jangɗee ɗu wa keeh te wa lee haa, mbaa risaat ŋ Kiristaani, findi Fuuɗsi jangɗoh ɗu.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓuuciŋ Kooh na bakaaɗeeɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Ɗiski wa nik, kuɓuuciŋ ngo, risaat ŋ Kiristaani, po mbeha a teeɓkohan, wa raak ɓoo riifiɗ na ooluk, ɓoo raakuu kaci ŋ fikiice ne a hay ɗah. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Ɗu inhiɗ ne a yurhiɗ ɗah, ɗu namiɗ inah ne ɓo' nu na pese ŋ yurah ɗah, a rimkoh nga ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Markaat findi Baabi waaɗoh ɓoo po ɓoo ɓeeɗkohsee kuɓu Kooh te weɗ ɓoo nik ! Adina inahɗi Kooh, weɗ tah wa inahɗi ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ɗiski wa nik ndii ɓoo kuɓu Kooh, te ini ɓoo nikan kim teeɓohuuɗi paaɗ. Waaye, ɓoo inhiɗ ne mbaɗna wa teeɓohsan, ɓoo mandan na ɗe, laam ɓoo hey ɗe hote findi a mand keeh-keeh.<verse eid="1JN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Ɓo' nu raak yaakaareem ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> ɗah, a na hoolɗe hooliɗ haf ce findi yeem hooloh. <verse eid="1JN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Ɓo' nu nik tumoh bakaaɗ ɗah, a na tume ini hunɗi na waasiŋ Kooh, laam bakaaɗ, weɗ sang teyɗuk waasi. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Moona, ɗu inhiɗa : Ini tah Yeesu hay weɗ ne a nihis bakaaɗ ci. Te a yi, a raakɗi bakaaɗ. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Ɓo' nu gen nga ɗe ɗah, na bakaaɗeeɗi ; ɓo' nu na bakaaɗe ɗah, hotohɗi ɗe, inahɗi ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Kuɓuuciŋ ngo, ali ɓo' kinaat ɗu muuƴiɗ. Ɓo' nu na tume in yurhiɗ ɗah, a yurhiɗ findi Kiristaani yurhoh. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Ɓo' nu gen ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, a ɓaah ŋ Seytaani, laam Seytaani bakaaɗ ŋ camba poyi. Ini tah <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> hay weɗ ne a yahroh in ci Seytaani haɓiɗ.<verse eid="1JN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Ɓo' nu rimuk ŋ Kooh ɗah, a na tumeeɗi bakaaɗ, laam ini Kooh sok nga ɗe findi tisoh, genan nga ɗe ; a minɗi bakaaɗ laam a kuɓu Kooh kotii. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Ini ɗalohiɗ kuɓuuciŋ Kooh na kuɓuuciŋ Seytaani weɗi wii : Ɓo' nu na tumeeɗi yurhiɗ wala a waaɗɗi ɓaah ce ɗah, a wuu Kooh haa.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗtiɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Inii weɗ yegɗohi ɗu kerah ŋ camba poyi an : Ɓoo waaɗtiɗohaat ; <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />ɓoo kinaat tum findi Kayin, yi ɓaahee ŋ Seytaani, a boommba taambɗoh ce. A boomoh ɗe ye ? E tumohaaɗ caŋ ɗe haf ce ceɗ sepƴe, caŋ taambɗoh ce nikka yurhiɗ, weɗ tah a boommba ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:1-16">Camba 4:1-16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Kon ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɓi Adina sang ɗu ɗah, kinaat feyu.<verse eid="1JN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne ɓoo puloh ŋ kakaan, ɓoo hayiɗ ŋ kipes, te waaɗi ɓoo waaɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, weɗ teeɓoha. Ɓo' nu waaɗɗi ɓooɓi ɗah, a ris ŋ kakaan. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Yaa nu sang ɓaah ce ɗah, a apoh ɓo'. Te ɗu inhiɗ ne ali apoh ɓo' raakɗi kipes ki heyɗi reehe ŋ ɗooƴ ce.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Inii weɗ inhiɗ ɓoo waaɗoh : Yeesu eɗohiɗ kipes kiŋ ɗe wuu ɓoo. Mbaa ɓoo joyiɗ nam eɗoh kipes ciŋ ɓoo wuu ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Waaye ɓo' raak, a hot ne ɓaah ce raakiɗ etoh, a rang keeñiŋ ɗe nga ɗe ɗah, waaɗohi puloh ŋ Kooh genoh na nga ɗe ?<verse eid="1JN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Kuɓuuciŋ ngo, waaɗohiŋ ɓoo kinaat top ŋ nguɓ ci dong, waaye wa hunaat na tumohaaɗ na keeh. <verse eid="1JN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Ŋ ineem, ɓoo hey inhe ne ɓoo ɓaah ŋ keeh ki, te ɓoo hey raake jam ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Ali ɓoo atte haf ɓoo sah, ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kooh a yi uup yak liiɓ ciŋ ɓoo te a inhiɗ in ci jen. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, liiɓ ciŋ ɓoo ambɗi ɓoo findi yurhaaɗi ɗah, ɓoo raakiɗ ooluk ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />Te in nu ɓoo kiim ɗe ɗah, ɓoo rahasa nga ɗe, laam ɓoo ɓii taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ ɗe te ɓoo na tume ini neɓ ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Inii weɗ nakohiŋ ɗe : Weɗ ne ɓoo kos ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yeesu Kiristaa, te ɓoo waaɗoh ŋ harmban ɓoo findi a nakoh ɓoo wa. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Ɓo' nu taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ Kooh ɗah, a gen ngaŋ Kooh, te Kooh gen nga ɗe ; ŋ inii, ɓoo inhiɗ ne a gen nga ɓoo : sagu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> a eɗ ɓoo.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s">Findi Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh na inhisohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, kinaat kos ɓooɓi jen, ɓi na woye ne a <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na woyɗukohee ɓa ; markisaat ɓa baahiɗ po ɗu inah andi fuuɗsi na woyɗukohee ɓa puloh ŋ Kooh wala ; laam adinaani woti-woti, ɓo' laayiɗ na tume haf ɓa woosuuɗ te ɓa nikɗaa. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Ɗu na hee inhisohe <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> an : Ɓo' nu woo jahran ne Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> hayiɗ na faan ɗah, ini woyɗukoh ɗe puloh ŋ Kooh ; <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />te waa nu teyɗukɗi Yeesu yeem ɗah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka ini fiisu ŋ saar 2, aaya 22.</char></note>, wa pulohɗi ŋ Kooh, waaye wa liiɓiŋ sangiɗiŋ Kiristaani ; ɗu kerheen ne wa ɗii hay te ɗiski wa nik, wa ɗii ŋ Adina.<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Ɗu ɓi kuɓuuciŋ ngo, ɗu ɓaah ŋ Kooh, te ɓooɓi tum haf ɓa woosuuɗ ɓeem, e ɗu saah ɓa, laam Yi nik nga ɗu a yi uup yak yi nik ŋ Adina. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Ɓeɗ, ɓa ɓaah ŋ Adina ; weɗ tah woo kiŋ ɓa woo Adina te ɓi Adina ɓa ɗii sikɗuk ɓa. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Ɓoo nak, ɓoo ɓaah ŋ Kooh ; ɓo' nu inah Kooh ɗah na sikɗuke ɓoo sikɗuk ; yi ɓaahɗi ŋ Kooh, na sikɗukeeɗi ɓoo. Ɓoo na inhisohe Fuuɗsiŋ keeh ki na wi na muuƴɗohe ɗaa.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗohiŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:7">ɓoo waaɗtiɗohaat ŋ harmban ɓoo ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:7">laam waaɗoh puloh ŋ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:7">te ɓo' nu waaɗ morom ce ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:7">a rimkoh ŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:7">te a inhiɗ Kooh.<verse eid="1JN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Ɓo' nu waaɗɗi morom ce ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:8">a moosɗi inhoh Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1JN 4:8">laam Kooh, a waaɗoh.<verse eid="1JN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Kooh teeɓohiɗ waaɗi a waaɗ ɓoo ŋ inii : Woosi a woos <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> yino-kongi ŋ Adina ne ɓoo pes taamboh nga ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Te waaɗoheem nikɗi haa ne e ɓoo waaɗ Kooh, waaye a yi waaɗ ɓoo te a woossa Kuɓkiŋ ɗe ne a nik seeƴkaahi nihsan bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="1JN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, Kooh waaɗiɗ ɓoo waaɗeem jen, mbaa, ɓoo joyiɗ nam waaɗtiɗoh ŋ harmban ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Ali ɓo' hotohɗi Kooh. Waaye ɓoo waaɗtiɗoh ŋ harmban ɓoo ɗah, a genan nga ɓoo, te waaɗohiŋ ɗe hey mite nga ɓoo.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Inii weɗ na inhiɗe ɓoo ne ɓoo gen ŋ Kooh, te a gen nga ɓoo : eɗi a eɗ ɓoo Fuuɗsiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Ɓoo hotiɗ ne Baabi a yi woos Kuɓki ne a nik Mucɗohiŋ Adina te ɓoo ɓii seede wa. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Ɓo' nu woo jahran ne Yeesu a yi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ɗah, Kooh gen nga ɗe, te a gen ŋ Kooh.<verse eid="1JN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Te ɓoo inhiɗ waaɗi Kooh waaɗ ɓoo, te ɓoo kosiɗa. Kooh, a waaɗoh, te ɓo' nu gen ŋ waaɗoh ɗah, a gen ŋ Kooh, Kooh gen nga ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Waaɗohi mitiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo ŋ raaki ɓoo raak hel daliɗ ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, laam findi a mand, ɓoo mand ɗaa ŋ adinaanii. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Waaɗoh hunɗi na neƴƴoh, waaɗoh keeh-keeh na aañe aañ neƴƴoh, laam neƴƴoh na seke mbugal, kon ɓoyi neƴƴoh, waaɗoh mitɗi nga ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo nak, a yi koc waaɗ ɓoo, weɗ tah ɓoo waaɗiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Ɓo' woo ne a waaɗiɗ Kooh, te a sang morom ce ɗah, a leyoh ; ɓo' nu waaɗɗi morom ce yi a na hote ɗah, a minɗi waaɗ Kooh yi a hotɗi. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Te ɓoo rahsoh nakohii nga ɗe an : « Yaa nu waaɗ Kooh ɗah, a namaat waaɗ ɓaah ce. »<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s">Kos seedeeniŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Ɓo' nu kos ne a Yeesu, a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> ɗah, ɓoyeem, a kuɓu Kooh, te ɓo' nu waaɗ Baabi, yi na rime ɗah, a waaɗiɗ ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Ŋ inii ɓoo inhiɗ ne ɓoo waaɗiɗ kuɓuuciŋ Kooh : Ɓoo waaɗiɗ ɓa ne ɓoo waaɗ Kooh te ɓoo taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ ɗe ɗah. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Laam waaɗ Kooh weɗ ne ɓoo taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ ɗe. Te nakoh ciŋ ɗe ɓitɗi, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />laam ɓo' nu rimkoh ŋ Kooh ɗah, a miniɗ saah Adina ; te ini saah Adina, weɗ kosi ɓoo kos.<verse eid="1JN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Ya ɓa a yi min Adina ɗal yi kos ne Yeesu a <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ? <verse eid="1JN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Yeesu Kiristaa yeem, a yi hay taamboh ŋ masuɓ na ñif ne a muciɗ ɓoo ; a taamboh ŋ masuɓ dong haa, waaye ŋ masuɓ na ñif ; te a <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na seede'ee wa, laam Fuuɗsi a yi keeh ki. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Seede kaahay raakiɗ : <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Fuuɗsi na masmi na ñif mi, te ca kaahay jen ca huniɗ.<verse eid="1JN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Ɓo' seede ɗah, a na kosse kosu ; waaye seedeeniŋ Kooh weɗ uupiɗ hatil, te wii weɗ seedeeniŋ Kooh : A seede'iɗ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Yaa nu kos Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ɗah, a raak seedeeneem ŋ ɗooƴ ce ; yaa nu kosɗi seedeeniŋ Kooh ɗah, a amb Kooh findi leyoh, a kosɗi seedeeni Kooh seede Kuɓkiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="1JN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Seedeeneem weɗ ne Kooh eɗiɗ ɓoo kipes ki reehanɗi te kipes keem weɗi ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Yi raak Kuɓki a yi raak kipes ki ; yaa nu raakɗi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ɗah, raakɗi kipes. <verse eid="1JN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Ŋ fiis ɗu in ceem ne ɗu inah ne ɗu raakiɗ kipes ki reehanɗi, ɗu ɓi kos Kuɓkiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="1JN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Oolki ɓoo raak nga ɗe, weɗ ne in nu ɓoo kiim te wa hun na waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe ɗah, a kerah ɓoo. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Te ɓoo inah ne a yii kerah ɓoo ŋ in nu ɓoo kiim ɗe ɗah, ɓoo namiɗ inah ne ɓoo rahsiɗ in ci ɓoo kiim.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiimɗaat kosiɗ ci na bakaaɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Ɓo' hot yino ŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci bakaaɗee, bakaaɗi ɓekɗi ɗe kakaan ɗah, a kiimɗaat ɗe Kooh, a onu kipes ; a hey wa one ɓi bakaaɗɗi bakaaɗi ɓek ɓa kakaan. Waaye raakiɗ bakaaɗi na ɓekohe kakaan. Ineem tahɗi so nakoh kiim Kooh. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />In yurhaaɗi nu nik ɗah, wa bakaaɗ, waaye raakiɗ bakaaɗ ci ɓekɗi ɓo' kakaan. <verse eid="1JN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne yaa nu rimkoh ŋ Kooh ɗah, a na bakaaɗeeɗi. A Kuɓkiŋ Kooh na niiɗee ɗe, Seytaani minɗi ɗe laal.<verse eid="1JN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne ɓoo ɓooɓiŋ Kooh te Adina jen wa ɗii ŋ yaah Seytaani. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Te ɓoo namiɗ inah ne Kuɓkiŋ Kooh hayiɗ, te a eɗiɗ ɓoo ñaañ ne ɓoo inhisoh Kooh, Keeh-keehi ; te ɓoo ɓii ngaŋ Kooh, Keeh-keehi, ngaŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yeesu Kiristaa. Yeem, a Koohi keeh-keehi, kipes ki po faw. <verse eid="1JN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Komaakciŋ ngo, wortukaat kooh ci nikɗi keeh.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>